---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Foysal Abdullah" description="Privacy Policy for foysalabdullah.com">
  <main class="container" style="padding-top: 140px; padding-bottom: 80px; max-width: 800px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 40px;">Privacy <span class="gradient-text">Policy</span></h1>
    
    <div class="glass-panel" style="padding: 40px; color: var(--text-muted);">
      <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">Last updated: August 2026</p>
      
      <h2 style="color: var(--text-main); margin: 30px 0 15px;">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">When you visit foysalabdullah.com, we may collect basic analytics data to understand how the site is used. If you use the Cal.com integration to book a meeting, you will provide your name and email directly to their secure platform.</p>

      <h2 style="color: var(--text-main); margin: 30px 0 15px;">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">Any information collected is used solely to communicate regarding potential motion design projects and improve the website experience. We do not sell or share your data with third parties.</p>

      <h2 style="color: var(--text-main); margin: 30px 0 15px;">3. Cookies</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">This site relies on standard browser cookies to function properly (like remembering if you prefer light or dark mode). You can disable cookies in your browser settings at any time.</p>

      <h2 style="color: var(--text-main); margin: 30px 0 15px;">4. Contact</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about this policy, please reach out via the contact button on the homepage.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>